OL,3,GNEWSACouple surprise wedding guests
OL,4,Awith mini steam train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who met while working for a
OL,7,Ftrain company gave their guests a
OL,8,F"complete surprise" at their wedding
OL,9,Fwhen they put on a miniature steam
OL,10,Ftrain to take them to the venue.
OL,12,FHelen and Rory Appleton, from Golborne,
OL,13,Fnear Wigan, have been together for 10
OL,14,Fyears and tied the knot at Bashall Barn
OL,15,Fin Clitheroe, Lancashire, last week.
OL,17,F"Without the railway there's no me and
OL,18,FHelen," Rory said, "So we felt it only
OL,19,Fnatural to include some railway
OL,20,Felements into the wedding."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
